    "readmeMarkdown": "## Fetch\n\nRuns the official local `mcp-server-fetch` server over STDIO. It exposes a single `fetch(url)` tool that retrieves a web page and converts it to Markdown for the agent. Every fetch requires explicit confirmation.\n\nThis server can access local/internal IP addresses and may represent a security risk. Exercise caution when using this MCP server to ensure this does not expose any sensitive data."
